Server init.
>> a := Blob chatsopano: 4.
a bytes: ( Mndandanda chatsopano ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob chatsopano: 4.
b bytes: ( Mndandanda chatsopano ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a chatsopano.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Zotuluka lembani: ['xorred:'], mzere-watsopano. 
Zotuluka lembani: n, mzere-watsopano. 
} gwira: { :e Zotuluka lembani: e, mzere-watsopano. }, yamba.
a masula.
b masula.
